<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - APPLE UPGRADED.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - APPLE UPGRADED.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bear Stearns raised its rating on the shares of Apple Computer Inc to attractive from unattractive, a source at the brokerage firm said on Thursday.</p>
<p>-- Further details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Microsoft Corp said on Wednesday it planned to invest $150 million in the troubled computer maker, which was also revamping its board of directors.</p>
<p>-- The stock closed at 26-5/16.</p>
<p>((Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
